\newlabel{fig:v501-blind-pull-history}{{45}{67}{Signal-extraction pull means from the same historical training-exclusion comparison. The mass-dependent offsets supplement the recovery diagnostics in Figs.~\ref {fig:v501-blind-optimization-history} and \ref {fig:v501-blind-significance-history}. These are historical conditional response tests for the stated generating truth and masks.\relax }{figure.caption.54}{}}
