\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {68}{\ignorespaces Local significance under the same template-width variations. The plotted signed local coordinate is $r=\operatorname  {sign}(\setbox \z@ \hbox {\mathsurround \z@ $\textstyle A$}\mathaccent "0362{A})\sqrt  {2[\mathrm  {NLL}(0)-\mathrm  {NLL}(\setbox \z@ \hbox {\mathsurround \z@ $\textstyle A$}\mathaccent "0362{A})]}$; its negative branch describes deficits. The 1.2-width template changes the 78\nobreakspace  {}MeV value from 2.810 to 3.216 and the 71\nobreakspace  {}MeV value from $-4.019$ to $-4.239$. The 66\nobreakspace  {}MeV reference changes from 2.366 to 2.478 for the 0.8-width template.\relax }}{100}{figure.caption.87}\protected@file@percent }
