\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {146}{\ignorespaces Signed local significance and local asymptotic excess probabilities. All four initial GP supports reach the inherited ceiling of eight resolution units. Raising the nominal-support ceiling to 16 removes every active boundary; ceilings 32 and 64 recover the same optima, with maximum root changes below 0.00054. The local polynomial is a separate background-family check. Gray shading identifies the 20--22 MeV bridge. Triangles mark the $10^{-6}$ display floor, not resolved global tails.\relax }}{221}{figure.caption.194}\protected@file@percent }
