\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {147}{\ignorespaces Fixed 15 and 17 MeV hypotheses. Top: data, sideband background constraint, profiled background and signal-plus-background prediction. Bottom: data minus the background profiled with signal, with the fitted Gaussian contribution. The error bars describe counting uncertainty only. The subtraction uses the same data to fit the background and is not an independent pull test.\relax }}{222}{figure.caption.195}\protected@file@percent }
